  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gole Ko Law cooperative Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vegetable Gardening and Fruit Production, 137 men 380 women, The project funds will be used to rehabilitate and improve the land development plan and irrigation system as well as install a fence to protect the field from roaming animals. The Cooperative will install an improved canal and basin system and purchase a water pump to provide a reliable and constant source of water to the production perimeter. These activities will enable Cooperative members to dramatically increase the volume of vegetables and fruit sold and the profit earned by group members.</narrative>
  </description>
